 Yogurt","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Juice Bars & Smoothies","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Specialty Food","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9CRWWbw3iOo4-9FMAO6nKw","review_id":"Z967_iR4mqeTnrwCrtuCTw","date":"2019-10-21T16:15:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9369238018989563,"text_excerpt":"SO DELISH!! I will need a gym membership if we continue to visit this fine establishment. The first time we went there, I ordered the Cubano and the BF ordered the lobster po boy. The fries are rolled up with the sandwich and they are so tasty and hearty. We loved the sandwiches and ate every crumb. We just revisited them this past Saturday after the Krewe of Boo parade and they were about to close but stayed open to cook us up another lobster po boy for the beau and I tried the Philly cheesesteak po boy. DAMN!! It was better than the cheesesteak I had in Philly! I really want to try every sandwich on the menu..."},{"business_id":"9CRWWbw3iOo4-9FMAO6nKw","review_id":"5o6r_YmdWdHMhV3_gReNPg","date":"2018-05-28T05:43:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9349935054779053,"text_excerpt":"This place is awesome! My boyfriend and I stopped by for lunch today because we didn't want to wait at the other restaurant we were trying to go to. We were so glad we ended up at Fat Boy Pantry! We had the lobster po boy and the Greek sandwich and both were fantastic in terms of flavor. The Greek sandwich was the best sandwich we've had a long time. The meat was a little fatty (yum!) and really well prepared. Even though the fries were thicker than your typical fries, they maintained a degree of crispiness, so they were still pretty good. It only took about 10 minutes for both sandwiches to be ready. The sandwiches came out wrapped along with the fries. Very friendly service. Also, the s..."},{"business_id":"9CRWWbw3iOo4-9FMAO6nKw","review_id":"cxWUscnRawC9PmPPQHL_gg","date":"2020-04-17T01:58:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9332048892974854,"text_excerpt":"We keep going back. Fat Boy Pantry is the most incredible sandwich shop in this town of great sandwich shops. They have the closest thing to a real Philly Cheese Steak you'll find south of Cottman Ave. The Greek sandwiches on pita, the Cuban pannini, they even offer a Fried Lobster PoBoy (!) And Allison are a near religious experience. Everything comes with their great thick cut fries too. There's also complementary serve-yourself club soda on tap, a killer selection of premium quality ice cream, and a wild array of obscure alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverage choices. Friendly service and very fair prices. To be honest, I can't wait to go back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9CRWWbw3iOo4-9FMAO6nKw","photo_id":"Cmow-TUVp4BpLTAtYDsAQg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Cmow-TUVp4BpLTAtYDsAQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8637986183166504},{"business_id":"9CRWWbw3iOo4-9FMAO6nKw","photo_id":"RtxkfN-IyUtpHLgnR64jnA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/RtxkfN-IyUtpHLgnR64jnA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8629392385482788},{"business_id":"9CRWWbw3iOo4-9FMAO6nKw","photo_id":"KTGHiS4D0-PiFrykSJssGg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/KTGHiS4D0-PiFrykSJssGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8495030999183655},{"business_id":"9CRWWbw3iOo4-9FMAO6nKw","photo_id":"2KDxg08Ks70h6UABAA2y1g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/2KDxg08Ks70h6UABAA2y1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8312620520591736},{"business_id":"9CRWWbw3iOo4-9FMAO6nKw","photo_id":"dk1WQHb5ym1z_DNX7NRbhw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/dk1WQHb5ym1z_DNX7NRbhw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7458057999610901}]},"notebook_case":null}
